%% id: project1-stream-error-state
%% title: 流式响应错误状态机
%% alt: 请求从接收进入 Streaming 后可正常完成、客户端取消、上游超时或协议错误并以终止事件收口
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Accepted
    Accepted --> Streaming
    Streaming --> Completed: final + usage
    Streaming --> Cancelled: client disconnected
    Streaming --> Failed: timeout or invalid event
    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
